(33, 'grey musilli', 'greymusilli@gmail.com', NULL, '5858131217', 'This is my fathers truck that we sold about a year ago, shortly after he passed away. I have been trying to find it for a while now but with no luck. I finally reached out to our old insurance company and got the VIN off of the insurance application forms. Honestly, I never thought I would see this truck again.. it was a surreal moment when I finally found it on your website. If it is still available, please let me know. Hopefully we could work something out.\r\n\r\nThank you', '1005519', '73516', '2018-05-24 13:21:40', '2018-05-24 13:21:40', '0'),
